abstract: >-
  An end-to-end practical handbook for the course CSU2543 — Digital Images
  Processing — at Shoolini University. Implements the eight prescribed
  experiments (loading and display, sampling-rate effects, intensity
  transforms, gamma correction, histogram equalization, histogram matching,
  2D correlation/convolution, and spatial filtering) in three independently
  runnable forms: Jupyter notebooks, an interactive Flask web app, and a
  fully-static client-side build. Includes a printable lab handbook with
  cover, certificate, acknowledgement, index, per-practical QR codes,
  watermark, and per-practical page numbering.
